73 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 45 0 R
/E (This exercise does not introduce a new data table; the report, dashboard, and custom page all read from the same Hotel_Booking_Form record set created in Experiment 4. The List Report \(Booking_Sales\) presents these records grouped by Processing_Department. The Dashboard aggregates the same records into chart widgets keyed on Age, Preferred_Room_Type, Preferred_Checkin_Date, and Guest_Requests_Notes. The Custom Page \(HMS\) then combines the List Report and the Dashboard widgets into one consolidated view so the front office does not need to navigate between separate report and dashboard pages during daily operations.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
